      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I made a controller to do that as well and yes, I use a toggle to turn off locomotion. Only option since your body point where you look.\nGo try it with the avatar in there.\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_109d439d-a56b-461e-8194-d5f4c706e602",
